msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
msgid "Your beam cycle time has been reduced. Jenny McGuire thanks you again and leaves %s to resume her work on %s"
msgstr "Su tiempo de ciclo de vigas se ha reducido. Jenny McGuire te agradece de nuevo y deja %s para reanudar su labor sobre %s"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:2396
msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
