msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "You successfully handled the Kraylor threat"
msgstr "Has manejado con éxito la amenaza de Kraylor"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:4976
msgctxt "Kraylor-shipLog"
msgid "[Human Navy Regional Headquarters] All Human Navy vessels are hereby ordered to assist in the repelling of inbound Kraylor ships. We are not sure of their intent, but we are sure it is not good. Destroy them before they can destroy us"
msgstr "Todos los buques de la Armada Humana están ordenados a ayudar en el replanteamiento de los buques Kraylor inbound. No estamos seguros de su intención, pero estamos seguros de que no es bueno. Destruirlos antes de que puedan destruirnos."

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:4977
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Kraylor-shipLog"
msgid "This includes you, %s"
msgstr "Esto te incluye a ti, %s"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:4978
msgctxt "KraylorOrders-comms"
msgid "Repel Kraylor"
msgstr "Repel Kraylor"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5125
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Kraylor-shipLog"
msgid "Looks like the Kraylor have developed some kind of planet busting weapon. They just destroyed %s with it. Keep them away from %s!"
msgstr "Parece que el Kraylor ha desarrollado algún tipo de arma de caza planetaria. %s Mantenlos alejados de %s!"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5126
#, lua-format
msgctxt "KraylorOrders-comms"
msgid "Save planet %s from Kraylor destruction like they destroyed %s by keeping the Kraylor away from %s."
msgstr "Save planeta %s de la destrucción de Kraylor como ellos destruidos %s manteniendo lejos al Kraylor %s."

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5140
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Kraylor-shipLog"
msgid "Oops, there goes %s"
msgstr "Oops, ahí va %s"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5142
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "You've saved planet %s"
msgstr "Has salvado el planeta. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5187
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Planet %s was destroyed"
msgstr "Planeta %s fue destruido."

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5192
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "station %s destroyed"
msgstr "estación %s destruidos"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5280
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "A contract destination station was destroyed"
msgstr "Se destruyó una estación de destino de un contrato"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5291 scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5333
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"Mourning over the loss of the station has halted all business\n"
"The mission is over"
msgstr "El relámpago por la pérdida de la estación ha parado todo negocio La misión ha terminado"

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5300
#, lua-format
msgctxt "contract-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Captain's Log] Why can't the Exuari just leave us alone? I don't understand what it is about them that makes them want to prey on everyone.\n"
"The upgrades for %s are very nice. They certainly came in handy. With the confidence of stations %s, %s and %s, I feel we will succeed as the space entrepeneurs we want to be."
msgstr "¿Por qué el Exuari no puede dejarnos solos? No entiendo qué es sobre ellos lo que los hace querer presa de todo el mundo. %s Son muy agradables, pero han venido muy bien con la confianza de las estaciones. %s, %s y %sCreo que tendremos éxito como los entrepeneurs espaciales que queremos ser."

#: scripts/scenario_47_scavenger.lua:5348
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Jenny-shipLog"
msgid "Jenny McGuire is now aboard. She's a bit paranoid and has sealed the door to her quarters. You'll have to contact %s to talk to her"
msgstr "Jenny McGuire está ahora a bordo, es un poco paranoica y ha sellado la puerta a sus cuartos. %s para hablar con ella"

